Band Description: A duo consisting of a disgraced botany PhD and an ex-hardcore DJ. They perform wearing reflective emergency blankets draped over leather trench coats, playing modified vintage synths that are bolted to genuine arctic storage lockers. Their stage presence is relentlessly jolly, involving manic choreography that mimics the frantic growth of a seedling under a UV lamp.

